{"reviewId": "304379475_84MyEK2Bq", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 7, "content": "1989 年日本为抑制经济过热被迫激进加息，利率升至 6%，这直接刺破了资产泡沫。股市和楼市价格暴跌，企业和居民财富大幅缩水，大量企业破产，银行坏账激增。此后日本经济陷入长期停滞，1991 - 2003 年 GDP 年均增速仅 1.14%，原本的 “失去的十年” 更是延续为 “失去的三十年”，通缩、内需疲软、产业活力不足等问题长期困扰日本经济。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "90年代日本“失去的十年", "range": "15319-15331", "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "304379475_84MyEK2Bq", "userVid": 304379475, "topics": [], "createTime": 1763565465, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 304379475, "name": "夏杨", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/wcib2GksmGOk9ryziaPUQKnkPqIM3P7rwApZsibVDaJEdzNIwIjFqQ2ZZuOXjQEbvrlDWAONTKmOWI/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "夏杨", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-100", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 4, "likes": [{"userVid": 904767961, "name": "ㅤX.", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/ZYoB75NwHv7wJ3R86tmpmzGzlOh14P5Jku8l6eIynvAHgZzhW3OJ7FbxgQDQblCSctCPtdYAAyM2Cq37sSWs9GTbZ19CMBLsPUfSjnS5S68/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 10}}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "目前我们在经历的通缩 低利率的环境下也没有人加杠杆 居民和企业都在降杠杆 ", "reviewId": "3043794